// The one primitive `index.js` uses, byte-faithful to the audited
// `@solidjs/signals@2.0.0-rc.3` declaration (`dist/types/signals.d.ts`), which
// `solid-js@2.0.0-rc.3` re-exports. A stub, so its name/version/integrity/
